  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日のレッスンはいつもよりいい感じだったな",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003020040,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "うん……前のレッスン……時間、短くなっちゃったから……\r\nその分……今日、頑張った……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500302/2015003020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか\r\n先生も、この間の遅刻を忘れるくらいだって褒めてたぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003020050,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "にへへ……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500302/2015003020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……それにしても、甜花の家での過ごし方には驚いたな\r\n休みの日はいつもあんな感じなのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003020060,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "うん……甜花の部屋で、一日……あんな感じで……\r\nネットとか、ゲームとか、してる……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500302/2015003020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003020070,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花……スマホと、パソコンがあれば……\r\nずっと、ごろごろできる……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500302/2015003020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほどな。……なら今日は時間もあるし、\r\nちょっと出かけてみるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003020080,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "え、えっと……どうして……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500302/2015003020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "たまには気分転換に\r\n外の空気をいっぱい吸うのも悪くないだろう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003020090,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "そっか……\r\nプロデューサーさんも、一緒なら……いいよ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500302/2015003020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし。……って言っても、どこがいいかな\r\n……甜花は行きたいところとか、してみたいことはないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003020100,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "え、えと……うーんと……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500302/2015003020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まぁ、そんな急には出てこないよな……\r\nここは近くのカフェにでも……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003020110,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "あ……プロデューサーさん……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500302/2015003020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、どこか行きたいところが出てきたか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003020120,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "あの……甜花、今日のレッスン……\r\n一生懸命、やったから……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500302/2015003020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003020130,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "その……\r\nご褒美が……欲しいな……",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500302/2015003020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（なるほど、ご褒美か……）",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "よし、何かあげよう",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "次のレッスンも\r\n頑張ったらな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "どんなものがいいんだ？",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003020140,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "え、ほんとに……？\r\nにへへ……ありがとう……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500302/2015003020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "それで……\r\n何を……もらえるの……？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500302/2015003020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うーん……そうだな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "せっかく外を歩くことにしたんだから、\r\n何かいいものを探しに行ってみるか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003020160,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "ご褒美……探し……\r\n甜花も……素敵なもの、一緒に探したい……",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500302/2015003020160"
  },
  {
