      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000,
      "easing": "easeInQuart"
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……はい\r\nこれで、もっと元気を出せるといいな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003020180,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "ありがとう……プロデューサーさん……\r\nにへへ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500302/2015003020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003020190,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "これで、いっぱいお昼寝して……これからも……\r\nレッスン、頑張るね……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500302/2015003020190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003020200,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "もし……頑張ったら……何が、もらえるの……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500302/2015003020200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは、そのときのお楽しみだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003020210,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "そっか……\r\n甜花、楽しみにしてるね……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500302/2015003020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003020220,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "だから……ご褒美、もらえるように……\r\n今度のレッスンも、いっぱい頑張るね……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500302/2015003020220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし、その意気だ。……とりあえず今日のところは、\r\n近くのカフェでお茶でも飲んで帰ろうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003020230,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "うん……にへへ……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500302/2015003020230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003020240,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……\r\n甜花、楽しみにしてるね……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500302/2015003020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。任せておけ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（さあ、甜花の頑張りに応えられるような、\r\nとびきり喜んでもらえるものを用意しないとな！）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003020250,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "えっとね……\r\n……ゲームセンターに、行ってみたい……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500302/2015003020250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし、じゃあ近くのゲームセンターを探して\r\n行ってみようか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003020260,
